      "title": "The context",
      "long_title": false,
      "wrap": "pretty",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "style": "plain",
          "text": "After the first study, one AI sketch-to-3D tool looked promising. Demos are always magic; the question was what happens in real work, week after week."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "The question",
      "long_title": false,
      "wrap": "pretty",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "list",
          "items": [
            "Understand real usage beyond the first wow",
            "Spot where the tool helps and where it breaks the workflow",
            "Decide whether to scale it"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
